{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/mrnk4u","slideIndex":0,"text":"0:35. I’m Livia Maria, and this is my Week 8 progress update for Turf Runner. I built it around a simple idea: a walk or run through Timișoara can change who owns a neighborhood in the game. I’ll show the current simulator build, explain how a GPS session turns into a turf record, and close with the tests and fixes I plan to complete next."}
