{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8b4v6g","slideIndex":5,"text":"0:45. User1 has two accepted friends, User2 and User3, and an incoming request from User4. The Friends screen also supports username search and lets players inspect a friend’s activity. Chat is tied to the player’s GPS neighborhood. Here the simulator is positioned in Iosefin, so User1 sees that neighborhood’s demo messages. The client checks periodically for new messages.\nScreenshots: User1 on the iPhone 17e simulator, friends.png and chat.png."}
