{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/6iju8x","slideIndex":9,"text":"0:45. The schedule is a proposal. In the next phase, I want to run on a physical iPhone and compare GPS and estimated steps on a real route. Then I’ll fix the Jest setup and add focused tests around authentication, session ownership and notifications. Finally I’ll check Android, move credentials to environment variables, prepare database backup and recovery, and rehearse the demonstration. The Week 8 simulator build is ready to show the main flow."}